### 查询订单可用消息动作（getMessagingActionsForOrder）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/messaging/operations/getMessagingActionsForOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"amazonOrderId":"114-1234567-1234567"}}

